</style></head><body>
{% include "nav.njk" %}
<header class="hero" id="top"><div class="wrap">
<div><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.hero_label }}</div>
<h1>{{ p.hero_heading | safe }}</h1>
<p>{{ p.hero_text }}</p>
<a class="btn" href="/contact.html">{{ p.hero_button }}</a></div>
<div class="sp" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sb"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-5-5"/></svg>search for your service…</div>
<div class="r top"><span class="ad">Ad</span><b></b><s></s><s></s></div><div class="r"><b></b><s></s><s></s></div><div class="r"><b></b><s></s><s></s></div></div>
</div></header>
<section id="why-important"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[0].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[0].heading }}</h2><h3>{{ p.sections[0].subheading }}</h3><p>{{ p.sections[0].text }}</p></div>
<div class="wi2">
<div class="it2 rv"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></i><h3>Reach Customers at the Right Moment</h3><p>Show your ads to people who are actively searching for what you offer.</p></div>
<div class="it2 rv"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z"/></svg></i><h3>Faster Visibility</h3><p>Get in front of potential customers sooner than with organic efforts alone.</p></div>
<div class="it2 rv"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3"/></svg></i><h3>Targeted Reach</h3><p>Target by keywords, location, device and audience to reach the people who matter.</p></div>
<div class="it2 rv"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 13h2M3 10h18"/></svg></i><h3>Control Over Budget</h3><p>Set and adjust budgets as you learn what works for your business.</p></div>
<div class="it2 rv"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></i><h3>Measurable Performance</h3><p>Track clicks, leads and conversions to understand what each campaign delivers.</p></div>
<div class="it2 rv"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg></i><h3>Flexible &amp; Scalable</h3><p>Scale what works and refine what doesn’t as your business goals evolve.</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="alt" id="services"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[1].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[1].heading }}</h2><h3>{{ p.sections[1].subheading }}</h3><p>{{ p.sections[1].text }}</p></div><div class="grid"><div class="card rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-5-5M11 8v6M8 11h6"/></svg><h3>Search Campaigns</h3><p>Text ads that appear when people search for your products or services, built around high-intent keywords.</p></div><div class="card rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M9 12h7M9 16h7"/></svg><h3>Display Campaigns</h3><p>Visual ads across Google’s network to build awareness and reach relevant audiences.</p></div><div class="card rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 4h3l2 12h10l2-8H7"/><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1"/><circle cx="17" cy="20" r="1"/></svg><h3>Shopping Campaigns</h3><p>Product-focused ads that help online stores show their products to people ready to buy.</p></div><div class="card rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 3l14 9-14 9z"/></svg><h3>YouTube Video Ads</h3><p>Video campaigns that help your brand connect with audiences on YouTube.</p></div><div class="card rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M2 12s4-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-4 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z"/></svg><h3>Remarketing</h3><p>Bringing back visitors who have already shown interest in your business.</p></div><div class="card rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s7-6 7-12a7 7 0 10-14 0c0 6 7 12 7 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/></svg><h3>Lead Generation Campaigns</h3><p>Campaigns structured to bring in enquiries and calls from potential customers.</p></div><div class="card rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3M5 5l2 2M17 17l2 2M19 5l-2 2M7 17l-2 2"/></svg><h3>Conversion Tracking Setup</h3><p>Setting up tracking with Google Tag Manager and Analytics so you can see what each campaign delivers.</p></div><div class="card rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg><h3>Optimization &amp; Reporting</h3><p>Ongoing improvements to keywords, ads and budgets, with clear reporting on performance.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sw"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[2].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[2].heading }}</h2><h3>{{ p.sections[2].subheading }}</h3><p>{{ p.sections[2].text }}</p><p style="margin-top:14px">I begin with your goals, audience and offers, and every keyword, ad and budget decision is made for a reason, so campaigns stay focused on what matters to your business.</p></div>
<div class="cmp rv"><div class="cp mut"><h3>Random Ads</h3><ul><li>Keywords chosen without customer intent</li><li>Ads launched without a clear goal</li><li>Budget spread without direction</li><li>Clicks tracked, results unclear</li></ul></div><div class="cp str"><h3>Strategic Google Ads</h3><ul><li>Keywords matched to customer intent</li><li>Ads aligned with your offer and landing page</li><li>Budget focused where it matters most</li><li>Conversions tracked and reviewed regularly</li></ul></div></div></div></section>
<section class="dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[3].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[3].heading }}</h2></div><div class="ap"><div class="st rv"><span class="n"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M15.5 8.5l-2 5-5 2 2-5z"/></svg></span><h3>1. Understand</h3><p>Understanding your business goals, offers and target customers.</p></div><div class="st rv"><span class="n"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-5-5M11 8v6M8 11h6"/></svg></span><h3>2. Research</h3><p>Researching keywords, competitors and audience intent.</p></div><div class="st rv"><span class="n"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M9 4h6v3H9zM9 14l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>3. Build</h3><p>Structuring campaigns, writing ads and setting up conversion tracking.</p></div><div class="st rv"><span class="n"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 3l14 9-14 9z"/></svg></span><h3>4. Launch</h3><p>Launching campaigns and monitoring early performance closely.</p></div><div class="st rv"><span class="n"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>5. Optimize</h3><p>Refining targeting, ads and budgets, and reporting clearly.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="alt sec-c"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[4].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[4].heading }}</h2></div><div class="rv"><a class="pill" href="/healthcare.html">Healthcare</a><a class="pill" href="/manufacturing.html">Manufacturing</a><a class="pill" href="/food.html">Food</a></div>
<div class="sh rv sub"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[5].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[5].heading }}</h2></div><div class="tpg" id="tools" style="justify-content:flex-start"></div></div></section>
<section class="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><div class="eyebrow">{{ p.sections[6].label }}</div><h2>{{ p.sections[6].heading }}</h2></div><div class="fq rv" id="fq"></div></div></section>
<section class="dark cta"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv"><h2>{{ p.sections[7].heading }}</h2><p>{{ p.sections[7].text }}</p></div>
<a class="btn" href="/contact.html">Get in Touch</a></div></section>
{% include "footer.njk" %}
<script>
const T=[["WordPress","W","#21759b"],["Wix","Wx","#0c6efc"],["Claude","✻","#d97757"],["ChatGPT","◎","#10a37f"],["Perplexity","P","#20808d"],["Semrush","S","#ff642d"],["Ahrefs","a","#ff7a00"],["Google Tag Manager","T","#4285f4"],["Google Analytics","▮","#e37400"],["Google Search Console","⌕","#34a853"],["Meta Business Suite","M","#0866ff"],["Meta Ads Manager","∞","#0081fb"],["Canva","C","#00c4cc"],["Mailchimp","✉","#e8b400"],["Google Business Profile","G","#ea4335"]];
const want=["Google Tag Manager","Google Analytics","Semrush","Canva"];
document.getElementById("tools").innerHTML=T.filter(t=>want.includes(t[0])).map(t=>`<div class="tp rv"><i style="--c:${t[2]}">${t[1]}</i>${t[0]}</div>`).join("");
const Q={{ p.faqs | faqsToQ | dump | safe }};
const fq=document.getElementById("fq");
fq.innerHTML=Q.map((q,i)=>`<div class="fi"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fa${i}">${q[0]}<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="fa" id="fa${i}" role="region"><div><p>${q[1]}</p></div></div></div>`).join("");
fq.querySelectorAll(".fi").forEach(f=>f.querySelector("button").addEventListener("click",()=>{const o=!f.classList.contains("open");fq.querySelectorAll(".fi").forEach(x=>{x.classList.remove("open");x.querySelector("button").setAttribute("aria-expanded","false")});if(o){f.classList.add("open");f.querySelector("button").setAttribute("aria-expanded","true")}}));
const io=new IntersectionObserver(e=>e.forEach(x=>{if(x.isIntersecting){x.target.classList.add("in");io.unobserve(x.target)}}),{threshold:.1});
document.querySelectorAll(".rv").forEach(el=>io.observe(el));
const L=document.getElementById("links");document.getElementById("bg").onclick=()=>L.classList.toggle("open");
L.querySelectorAll("a").forEach(a=>a.addEventListener("click",()=>L.classList.remove("open")));
const DD=[...document.querySelectorAll(".dd")],cl=()=>DD.forEach(d=>{d.classList.remove("open");d.querySelector(".ddb").setAttribute("aria-expanded","false")});
DD.forEach(d=>{const b=d.querySelector(".ddb");b.addEventListener("click",e=>{e.stopPropagation();const o=!d.classList.contains("open");cl();if(o){d.classList.add("open");b.setAttribute("aria-expanded","true")}})});
document.addEventListener("click",cl);document.addEventListener("keydown",e=>{if(e.key==="Escape")cl()});
document.querySelectorAll(".subb").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",e=>{e.stopPropagation();const s=b.parentElement,o=s.classList.toggle("open");b.setAttribute("aria-expanded",o)}));
document.addEventListener("click",()=>document.querySelectorAll(".sub.open").forEach(s=>{s.classList.remove("open");s.querySelector(".subb").setAttribute("aria-expanded","false")}));
</script></body></html>